   <title>File naming conventions</title>
   <shortdesc>Consistent file naming is essential for maintainability, searchability, and automation. To maintain consistent file names,</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>naming</keyword>
        <keyword>Avoids</keyword>
